  "evidence": [
    {
      "id": "G01",
      "title": "精确发布依赖而非浮动分支",
      "fact": "已取得 Ballista build.gradle 指定的 Fabric1.19 Gecko3.1.6 sources，发布SHA1与本地4600785f88b0cebef137d5e6dbdf4eb32c03e35c一致。POM声明geckolib-core1.0.14。",
      "limit": "1.19当前分支6b17247不是已证明3.1.6的源码，不拿它代替。",
      "sources": [],
      "credit_added": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "G02",
      "title": "动画先走super，再写模型观察角",
      "fact": "AnimatedGeoModel.setLivingAnimations调用preAnimationSetup/tickAnimation；Ballista覆写先super，再把head.rotationY、bow.rotationX和base Y/Z写定。",
      "limit": "只能闭合这些分量的调用先后，core控制器优先级/STOP仍未读，不能宣称所有组件重复旋转。",
      "sources": [
        {
          "local": "sources/geckolib3.1.6/software/bernie/geckolib3/model/AnimatedGeoModel.java",
          "sha256": "a35d1130b7333537c87a5213b397e237729fbf69bbd9b25de1fd434dd77f1e5d",
